    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono mu milimo kiefwe alala ne Wele, khumusaba enywe mu mwanyoola kumwalaalo kwa Wele mukhakulekha kwasasikha busa tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.49.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa. 49.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ulila niko Wele alomanga:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Se khwenya omundu yesi yesi anyoole kamakhiikha mu milimo kiefwe tawe, khwako se khukhaka khura sikundula khu ngila yo mundu yesi yesi tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali, buli mu siindu siosi siosi nisio khukhola khwekesia khuli efwe khuli bakholi ba Wele khulwe khukhwifwiilisia ne khukhwikhaliilikha mu linaanisibwa, mu buandalafu, ne mu butinyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.16.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bikh. 16.23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Khwakhupwa, khwabowa, ne khusangililwa; khwakhosibwa kimilimo lukali, khwareengecha ne khuonga enjala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwe bukwalaafu bwefwe ne bukesi ne liliefwiilisia ne kimiooyo kimilayi khweyekesie fwabeene khuba bakholi ba Wele khulwa Roho Omutakatifu, khulwe busiime bwefwe bwa ng'ali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "khulwe burume bwefwe bwe bung'ali ne bunyali bwa Wele. Khuli ne buluungi nga bulwaani bwefwe bwe khu khupanila ne khukhwitechela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khuelesebwa lukoosi ne lundi khuchangalaasibwa, khukhomwa lundi khufumisibwa. Khwabukulwa khuba babeeyi, ne khane khulomaloma bung'ali; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nga khukhamanyikhe tawe, ne khane khwamanyikha khu boosi, oli khukhwafwa ne kakhali khuli balamu nga mubona. Khwaba ne khuukuumwa, se khwirwa tawe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "khwakhaba ne khubeelesibwa, khuli basangaafu buli lwosi; khubonekha khuba bataambi, ne kakhali khukhola bakali khuba baiinda, khubonekha nga khukhali ne sisiindu tawe, ne khane ng'ali khuli na buli siindu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basaale bakoosi muli mu Korinjo! Khwalomalome khwinywe abuwaanga, khwamwikulila kimiooyo kiefwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Efwe se khwaloba khumusiima enywe tawe, enywe ninywe mumwaloba khu khusiima efwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luno ndomaloma busa oli enywe muli babaana base. Lekha kamebaasio kenywe khwifwe kabe nga niko efwe khuli nako khwinywe, yikula kimiooyo kienywe!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Likaambila khuloondekhana ne babaandu bakhamanyile Wele tawe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukhaambaana ne babaandu bakhasuubila tawe, sikila se linyala liakholekha tawe. Buwaanga bunyala bwaambaana ne sisiilima ku? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kristo ne Sietani banyala bafukiilisiana ku? Omusuubili no mundu okhasuubila baambanila khu siina? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.26.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bal. 26.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.37.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Esek. 37.27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.3.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bakor. 3.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.6.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "6.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Lukaangu lwa Wele lunyala lwafukiilisiana ne bifwaani bie bakhamanyile Wele luriena? Sikila efwe khuli Lukaangu lwa Wele omenyile mindali! Nga Wele omwene ne aalomile ali,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
